# Review routing for Hello-N00del/gremion.
#
# A public repository with no CODEOWNERS routes nothing: a pull request from a
# first-time contributor sits with no reviewer requested until someone happens
# to look at the tab. One catch-all owner is the minimum that fixes that.
#
# GitHub only ENFORCES this via branch protection ("Require review from Code
# Owners"). Without that setting it is a routing hint, not a gate — worth
# knowing before assuming a file is protected because it is listed here.

*                       @Hello-N00del

# Surfaces where a wrong change is expensive and quiet.
/LICENSE                @Hello-N00del
/NOTICE                 @Hello-N00del
/SECURITY.md            @Hello-N00del
/.github/               @Hello-N00del
/k8s/                   @Hello-N00del
/scripts/               @Hello-N00del
/docker/keycloak/       @Hello-N00del
